msgstr ""
"Faylasha xogta horay waa loo soo dejiyay!\nGuji Xiga si aad u sii wada"
"to"

#: src/onboarding.py:324
msgid "Error while downloading datafiles"
msgstr "Khalad markii la soo dejinayay xogta faylasha"

#: src/onboarding.py:327
msgid ""
"Done!\nClick Next to continue"
msgstr ""
"La sameeyay!\nGuji Xiga si aad u sii wadato"

