#: src/main.glade:122
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks "
"to the camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps ("
"or in daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to kee"
"p unlocking reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Kaliya hal nooc oo weji ah ayaa diiwaan gashan. Iftiinku wuxuu beddela"
"a sida wejigaagu u ekaado, sidaas awgeed hal nooc ayaa ku fashilmi kar"
"a fiidkii hoostiisa (ama iftiinka maalinta). Ku dar qaab labaad oo lag"
"u duubay iftiin kala duwan si aad u sii furto la isku halayn karo wakh"
"ti kasta oo maalinta ah."

