#: src/main.glade:655 src/onboarding.glade:116
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Furaha / KWallet Si toos ah u fur"

#: src/main.glade:672
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"U ogolow aqoonsiga wejiga si aad si toos ah u furto furahaaga gelitaan"
"ka ama KWallet markaad soo gasho. Tani waxay si ammaan ah u kaydinaysa"
"a eraygaaga sirta ah oo ku xidhan TPM marka la heli karo, ama lagu sir"
"eeyay AES-256-GCM iyadoo la isticmaalayo fure-sare-keliya. Wajiga auth"
" wuxuu dejiyaa PAM_AUTHTOK pam_gnome_keyring ama pam_kwallet5 taaso ku"
" xidhan miiskaaga."

